\subsection{Verification Strategy Selection Matrix}

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Option A (Pure Iris / RustBelt Integration):} Best fit if the Framekernel minimizes C/assembly stubs and exposes driver interfaces purely as safe Rust primitives validated via RustBelt semantics.
    \item \textbf{Option B (Sail + Katamaran + VRM):} Best fit if the multikernel partition layer relies heavily on explicit hardware memory barriers, shared page table manipulation across CPU cores, or capability extensions.
\end{itemize}
